      "id": 52,
      "name": "Gamified Onboarding Framework for Data Plaforms",
      "description": "Personnel who gain access to enterprise data platforms are often left without a clear path to becoming effective users. Traditional onboarding and training programs are frequently treated as a compliance exercise, with limited time, generic content, and passive learning formats that result in low knowledge retention and minimal real-world application. For Sailors and Marines operating at mission speed, training must be relevant, practical, and immediately actionable. Warfighters require access to SI capabilities to more easily query and exploit their data. Our challenge is to create an onboarding framework that delivers personalized, role-based guidance, accelerates time-to-value, uses SI tools such as Databricks Genie, and helps users confidently apply data platform capabilities to their day-to-day mission needs rather than simply completing training requirements.",
      "requirements": "a gamified onboarding framework supported by SI capabilities easily scaled to different government owned data platforms",
